WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
That is indeed a genius

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,680
more than that

3
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,880
Tianwei can also help us make accessories

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,400
He made a lot of accessories for me and Huang

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,080
He is far away from making a cross-level mecha

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,920
Just a little bit different

7
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,760
Sister Ma is the most powerful mecha master in Qilin, huh?

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,200
If he upgrades to A

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,480
Lila and the yellow mecha will definitely be over soon, so to speak

10
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,560
My mecha is also faster

11
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,360
You also need him to make your S-class mecha, otherwise?

12
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,640
We are a team

13
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,120
There's a queue here

14
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,800
If only he had always been A

15
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,280
Can’t give birth to an S-level child?

16
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:40,620
I believe Sister Ma can definitely check it out.

17
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,410
Why did the doctor say it's okay?

18
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,330
Just be fine

19
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:46,010
This kid's performance on a blind date is quite impressive.

20
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:47,770
It's really strange to have an innocent person faint today.

21
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,090
I remember when you were in freshman training

22
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:50,170
Isn't it good?

23
00:00:50,170 --> 00:00:51,130
How could you faint?
